Note: Native coefficient logits: FacetSign=-1 lowers the predicted score as the coefficient increases. Compare levels
within a scenario; origins may differ between scenarios. Conditional intervals hold anchors fixed; propagated intervals
include calibration uncertainty. Pointwise 95% normal approximations, not simultaneous intervals.
CoverageQualified=False: contrast coverage does not establish level coverage. Interval overlap is not a test of the
